# Smart Traffic Control System
Dibuat untuk tugas besar AI

## Requirements
- Python 3.11
- Virtual Environment ('venv')

## Setup on Windows / PowerShell
### Create venv
```
python -m venv .venv
```

### Activate venv
```
.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
```

### Install dependencies
```
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Run The Program
```
python tkinter_ui.py
```

## Too Lazy To Configurate?
Just run the ```setup.bat``` instead. The whole dependencies will be installed automatically. Only works for Windows PowerShell 